window.products.push({"id":101016,"name":"Pureline 5231JA2002A Replacement for Kenmore 9890, LG LT500P, LG GEN11042FR-08, LG 5231JA2002A, LG LFX25974ST, Refrigerator Water Filter. NSF 372 and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aXmJ290VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Triple Action Filtration: Pureline filters use advanced active coconut shell carbon block, with 2x larger surface area and more micropores. First the water passes through the pores of the filter, The water is further purified through two separate stages of ionization filtration that take place as the water passes through the carbon block to your refrigerator. the filter material in the Pureline refrigerator filter improves the overall taste of your water Safe and Secure with the best Certifications: Our filters are completely made with Lead-Free, BPA-Free and Food Grade materials, And its been verified by our NSF 372 and NSF 42 Certification. And WQA, and IAPMO. Our carbon blocks have been independently tested to filter your water. No Leakage and Perfect Fit Garanteed: No Worreis about water leakages, Pureline filters have been manufactured to the exact designs and specifications as the original Brand filter, with a precision measurement technology to make sure that you get the EXCAT same fit as the orignal Brand. installation is easy and simple, will take no longer then 2 Min to install when you follow the guidnce in the box. 300 Gallon of Fresh Water: the filter filters up to 300 gallons of water, or recommended to change every 6 months for an average household. Compatible Filter Models for LG LT500P; 5231JA2002 ; 5231JA2002A ; 5231JA2002A-S ; 5231JA2002B ; 5231JA2002B-S; ADQ72910901 ; ADQ72910902 ; ADQ72910907 ; GEN11042F-08 ; GEN11042FR-08. Compatible Filter Models for Kenmore 46 9890; 46-9890; 4609890000; 469890; 9890 Compatible Filter Models for Swift Green SGF-LA22. Compatible Filter Model for Aqua Fresh WF-290 ; WF290","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aXmJ290VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PURELINE","source_asin":"B07K8YVPMM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K8YVPMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K8YVPMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
