window.products.push({"id":101087,"name":"Antarctic Star Nugget Ice Maker Machine with Soft & Chewable Ice, Automatic 44lbs in 24 Hours,Electric Ice Making Machine with Ice Scoop, Self-Cleanin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ii9zJNr+L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAST ICE MAKING：Fill 2.2L of water into the water tank, maximum ice capacity can reach 44lbs in 24 hours. It won't make you feel anxious because of waiting, let you and your family have ice cubes all day long. Chewable nugget ice: Chewing-block ice is made from crushed ice cut with blades, as opposed to traditional hard block ice which are chewable, brittle,ready fast and retains its flavor. The optimal melting speed preserves the original flavor of cocktails and cold drinks. QUIET AND USER FRIENDLY: It makes ice with low noise. The transparent lid allows you to monitor the ice capacity. This ice maker has a simple operation panel that helps you quickly understand how to use it. When the water is insufficient or the ice basket is full, the indicator light will turn on . The main function includes: ice, clean and timer. SELF-CLEANING FUNCTION: Press “ICE/CLEAN” button for 5 seconds and the screen displays 20M and the “CLEAN” symbol (as shown in the picture below). It will run the cleaning procedure for 20 minutes and automatically exit. Press this button again during the cleaning procedure and it will exit immediately. SMALL FOOTPRINT: This mini ice maker measures just 11.14x14.76x17.24 inches. Large Capacity Based on Small Footprint, Small Enough to fit on most countertop and easy to store when not in use. It takes up less space at home or in the office, barbeques, outdoor parties, or basement bars.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ii9zJNr+L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antarctic Star","source_asin":"B09W9K8PM9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W9K8PM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W9K8PM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
