window.products.push({"id":101104,"name":"Vila Coffee Filter, Fine Mesh Coffee Maker, Stainless Steel Pour Over Coffee Dripper, Reusable, Lightweight, Paperless, Fits Standard Sized Coffee Pot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314TWScklSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Taste Your Coffee, Not The Filter --- Coffee lovers agree that maintaining the flavor profile of a specific kind of coffee is essential to thoroughly enjoying a cup of coffee. Common paper coffee filters are white or brown paper filters that can affect the taste of your coffee. To ensure that you taste the delicious flavor of your special coffee, use the Vila Stainless Steel Coffee Filter. Save Money And The Environment --- Instead of paying for single-use paper filters over and over again, why not make a tiny investment into a reusable stainless steel coffee filter? Not only will the Stainless Steel Coffee Dripper from Vila save you money, but it will benefit the environment as well. Using treated paper filters can seep into the ground when dumped in landfills. Excellent For Pour Over Tea Brewing --- Not everyone is a coffee aficionado, but the Vila Stainless Steel Filter is useful for a wide variety of herbs and teas as well. Loose herbs, tea leaves and tea bags of all sorts can be brewed using the handy filter. Simply place your oolong, green tea, Earl Grey, chamomile or Darjeeling tea into the mesh filter, pour on hot water and allow to steep. Compact, Fits Standard Sized Coffee Cups --- The compact and lightweight Vila Coffee Dripper stands 3.5” (9 cm) tall and has a 3.9” (10cm) bottom base. It sits perfectly atop almost any coffee cup or mug without wobbling while your coffee drips smoothly in. Portable and practical, the coffee dripper is an excellent tool in your home kitchen, office lounge and camp site. Made Using Durable, Reliable Materials --- Made using high quality 18/8 grade stainless steel, the Coffee Dripper from Vila is extra durable, and is able to handle high temperatures. Reinforced fine steel mesh is used so that no grounds end up in your coffee. Stainless steel is a superior choice to paper, plastic, ceramic and glass coffee filters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314TWScklSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VILA","source_asin":"B07QC5T94Z","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101104","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QC5T94Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QC5T94Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
