window.products.push({"id":101119,"name":"Whirlpool WOC54EC7AS 27\" Stainless Steel Electric Combination Wall Oven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WtA+46ynL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","description":"Whirlpool ® 4.3 cu. ft. Combination Microwave Wall Oven with SteamClean Option Clean up is easy with the 4.3 cu. ft. capacity combination microwave oven's SteamClean option. It cleans up after everyday light spills using only heat and 1-1/4 cups of water, so you can forget the harsh chemicals or cleaners. Thanks to the AccuBake ® temperature management system's built-in sensors, the oven also monitors temperature and the cooking elements to deliver consistent baking, even on multiple racks. You can even microwave and bake at the same time. Model Number Variations This model is similar to these older Whirlpool brand models: RMC275PVS","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WtA+46ynL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B0074Y1PTA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0074Y1PTA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0074Y1PTA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
