window.products.push({"id":101236,"name":"Commercial Ice Machine, 130LBS/24H, 60 Ice Cubes/Cycle Free Standing Under Counter Ice Maker w/Large Ice Bin, 2 Auto Water Inlet Modes, Self Clean, 24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f1qCCwpgL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Crazy Ice Making Speed for Commercial Use】 - Not just good-looking, but also a awesome professional commercial ice maker machine with fast ice making speed. It can produce 60 pieces of clear ice cubes every cycle, up to 130LBS per 24h. Own this ice maker, you no longer need to pay a huge amount of money to buy ice in the store. It will save you much more than this ice machine. 【22LBS Ice Bin with Thermal Insulation Foam Layer】 - The ice bin of this under counter ice maker is equipped with a thermal insulation foam layer which can effectively slow down the melting speed of ice. It can keep the ice frozen for about 3~5 hours at room temperature. Its 0.6 Cu.Ft. capacity allows it to hold up to 22LBS of ice. With the ice overproduction protection, it will save your water and electricity bill a lot. 【2 Auto Water Inlet Modes & Easy to Install】- 2 water inlet modes allow you to use tap water with water line or bucket water. And it only takes 2~4 steps to hook it up, almost installation free. You don't have to spend a lot of money to hire someone to install it. With stand alone design, it makes you can move the ice maker anywhere to make ice. 【Adjustable Ice Thickness & 24H On/Off Timer】 - Select the corresponding ice making time to obtain the ice cubes with the thickness you want.The longer the ice making duration, the thicker the ice will be. Set a 1~24 hours auto startup timing for ice making in advance to quickly obtain ice without waiting for it to make ice. 【One Key Self Cleaning & Blue Light】- One key automatic cleaning, without complicated operation steps. This ice maker is very easy to maintain and can continuously produce clean and healthy ice for you. With blue light, it gives you an excellent visual experience. So many functions are integrated into such a compact body (16.53(W)×14.96(D)×29.72(H) In). This commercial ice machine will be one of the best partner in your business and life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f1qCCwpgL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Climate Choice","source_asin":"B0BL76LWDT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL76LWDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL76LWDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
