window.products.push({"id":101244,"name":"𝐎𝐄𝐌 DC97-15459G Water Inlet Valve for SAMSUNG Washer - 5 Years Warranty-Replaces AP5623056 PS4220861 EAP4220861 3276197,Fits Models WA456DRHDSU WA48J7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kcvdng-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【𝐃𝐂𝟗𝟕-𝟏𝟓𝟒𝟓𝟗𝐆 𝐖𝐀𝐓𝐄𝐑 𝐈𝐍𝐋𝐄𝐓 𝐕𝐀𝐋𝐕𝐄 𝐒𝐀𝐌𝐒𝐔𝐍𝐆】GENUINE DC97-15459G Washer Water Inlet Valve 𝐒𝐀𝐌𝐒𝐔𝐍𝐆 with Mounting Bracket,High quality,good price, fast Amazon official logistics.This is a new GENUINE Samsung replacement part.( 110/120 V, 60 Hz),DC97-15459G Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve is made of high quality ABS plastic and stainless steel metal. It has undergone rigorous testing by the manufacturer .The high standard of production makes the water valve will not seep, not easy to rust, and prolong the service life. ✅ 【𝐏𝐑𝐎𝐃𝐔𝐂𝐓 𝐒𝐏𝐄𝐂𝐈𝐅𝐈𝐂𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐒】DC97-15459G Washer Water Inlet Valve Samsung has 2 threaded ports that are connected to hot and cold water hoses at the back of the washing machine. Each port is controlled by a solenoid valve that sends electric power to open and close the flow of hot and cold water based on settings for the wash temperature and signals from the water-level switch. Easy fix your Samsung washer problems:▶Leaking water inlet valve;▶Error code E4 F8, E1, LF, LO and FL, etc;▶wouldn't fill;▶Incorrect water filling▶Washed at the wrong water temperature ✅【𝐖𝐈𝐃𝐄𝐋𝐘 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐋𝐄 】Our DC97-15459G Water Inlet Valve fit Brand Samsung ►Directly Replace DC97-15459G,3276197 ,AP5623056, PS4220861,EAP4220861.Fits Modols: WA45K7600AW/ A2-00 ,WA456DRHDSU/AA-00,WA456DRHDSU/AA-01,WA456DRHDSU/AA02,WA456DRHDSU/AA-03, nWA456DRHDSU/AA-04,WA456DRHDSU/AA-05, WA50M7450AP /A4-00,WA50M7450AW/A4-00,WA52J8700AP/A2-00,WA48J7700AW/ A2-00,WA48J7700AW/A2-01,WA48J7700AW/A2-02,WA52M8650AV/ A4-00,WA56H9000AP/A2-00,WA56H9000AP/A2-01 ✅【𝐄𝐀𝐒𝐘 𝐃𝐈𝐘 𝐅𝐈𝐗】- Simple job ,Just remove hot and cold hoses, screws in cover, screws holding part in and electrical connections. Replace DC97-15459G Water Inlet Valve for SAMSUNG and then re-attach hoses, electrical connections and replace the cover. Re-attach hot and cold hoses.Only needed a phillips screwdriver to perform disassembly & repair⚠️Disconnect power and water source Before install. ✅ 【 𝟓 𝐘𝐄𝐀𝐑𝐒 𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐘】 This is a new GENUINE Samsung replacement part.,We’re confident in the design and quality of our DC97-15459G Water Inlet Valve. For any reason you're not completely satisfied, you can ask for a replacement or full refund in 5 years . If you are not sure whether this replacement part correctly fit your appliance, please feel free to contact us or ask a question through Amazon","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kcvdng-cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOMOON","source_asin":"B08RHH7K7D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RHH7K7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RHH7K7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
