window.products.push({"id":101250,"name":"Vencino Pour Over Coffee Dripper, Paperless & Eco-Friendly Reusable Stainless Steel Filter with Non-Slip Stand and Cleaning Brush,Fit Most Coffee Mug ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DKyOl1EsL._AC_SL1445_.jpg","description":"Gettin' Back to the Good Stuff: Tired of drinking coffee loaded with sugar and milk to cover the bitter taste? Life's too short to drink bad coffee! For us at Ol' Blue, living the good life means enjoying important things like friends, family, and good ol' mountain music. It's about appreciating simple moments, like watching a sunrise, or savoring that hand-crafted cup of coffee you just made from freshly ground beans. With the use of an Ol' Blue Dripper, you can get the best cup of coffee, without the bitterness, that you deserve to enjoy every day! New and Improved Design : We've taken customer reviews to heart and have improved durability. The Ol' Blue stainless steel dripper is resistant to corrosion and rust. It's compact and lightweight, making it great for travel, camping. The Ol' Blue dripper is hand washable and dishwasher safe. Economical: Stop wasting your hard earned money on expensive filters. Your Ol' Blue coffee dripper is all you need to make that perfect cup of drip coffee. It's reusable, micro mesh design, will help you get the best results without pulling out the essential oils and flavors like paper filters. For those couples, who don't get up at the same time, you don't have to drink the leftover, burnt coffee you have with coffee machines. Your Ol' Blue dripper is great for 1-2 cups at a time. Designed for Ease: The cone shape, double layered mesh design, including mesh bottom is essential for ensuring all the good coffee flavors will be slowly and evenly extracted. The 4\" base fits over all standard sized mugs. Click ADD TO CART in the upper, right corner to order your Ol' Blue Pour Over Coffee Dripper today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DKyOl1EsL._AC_SL1445_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vencino","source_asin":"B07DKFLCYY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DKFLCYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DKFLCYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
