window.products.push({"id":101426,"name":"(2023 Upgraded) OEM 6501KW2002A Washer Rotor Position Sensor Assembly by Beaquicy - Replacement for Kenmore LG Washers - Replaces PS3529186 AP4440680 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fyVHN29OL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【OEM 6501KW2002A WASHER ROTOR POSITION SENSOR】: The 6501KW2002A Washer Rotor Position Sensor Assembly is an OEM product. It monitors the direction and speed of the spinning rotor and communicates this information to the electronic control board. It senses the position of the motor. The package includes 1 x 6501KW2002A position sensor. ►If position sensor is broken, the washer will have the following conditions: The pump will not spin, LE (locked rotor) error code, the pump will not start. ✅【ABS PLASTIC】: The 6501KW2002A Washer Rotor Position Sensor is made of high quality ABS plastic material for excellent durability and firmness. This product senses the position of the motor and is therefore called RPS (rotor position sensor) or MPS (motor position sensor).The high quality material gives the sensor a thick wall that is less susceptible to wear and damage during daily use. This OEM product is available in white and offers the advantages of durability, robustness and long life. ✅【FIT LG KENMORE WASHING MACHINES】:6501KW2002A Position Sensor can replacement for LG, Kenmore washers.►Compatible:796.28862700, 796.28869700, 796.29872700, 796.29877700, 796.31522210, 79629002000, 79629002010, 79629272000, 79629272010, 79629272900, 79629278000, 79629278010, F1264FD, F1264FD8, F1264FD8, F1267FDX, F1267FDY, F1271FD, 29272, 29278, 29472, 29478, 31522, 31523, 40272, 40318, 40441, 40448, 40512, WT5101HV, WT5101HW, WT5170HW, WM2140CW, WM2240CW, WM0532HW, WM2050CW, WM3470HWA, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】: The OEM 6501KW2002A LG Washer Motor Sensor supports 365 days return and exchange. This OEM product, superior in quality and design to the non-original, has a long service life and a long warranty for greater peace of mind with your purchase. If your washer pumps but will not spin or agitate, commonly gives a \"LE\" (locked rotor) error. you may have a damaged sensor assembly. It needs to be replaced promptly. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】: The installation of 6501KW2002A Washer Position Sensor is simple. Wear gloves before you start and disconnect the power supply, hot and cold water supply and the drain. You need to open the washing machine casing first, find the motor and you will see where the sensor is located, disconnect the wires at the sensor and bracket, carefully remove the sensor and replace it with a new one. You can follow the installation videos on YouTube in case you make a mistake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fyVHN29OL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08319BCDX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101426","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08319BCDX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08319BCDX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
