window.products.push({"id":101663,"name":"Beaquicy 5231EL1003B Lint Filter Replacement for LG & Kenmore Dryers - Dryer Lint Screen Trap with Felt Seal - Fit for Part Number AP4440606 PS3527578","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZJVG8cWVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【5231EL1003B DRYER LINT FILTER】---Includes 1 x 5231EL1003B clothes dryer lint filter.Using a durable plastic construction, this filter can capture and capture your dryer fluff, helping to increase airflow, maximize drying efficiency and reduce drying time.Includes felt seal that goes along the edge of the filter to prevent air escaping from the outer edge of the filter.Gray in color. ✅ 【ABS FRAME CONSTRUCTION】 --- 5231EL1003B Clothes dryer lint filter assembly traps lint and debris from the exhaust air flowing from the dryer.It is completely designed with non-polluting, safe, hygienic and highly durable eco-friendly materials(ABS Frame Construction & updated Felt Seal Screen).☞If your dryer was lint filter broke, lint filter screen torn, vent ripped , you made to replace the lint filter. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】--- The 5231EL1003B dryer lint filter supports 365 days RETURN and EXCHANGE.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.If you have any questions during shopping, please contact customer service in time.☞ !!! PAY ATTENTION-5231EL1003B filter has a similiar shape with ADQ56656401 filter.Please contrast your old filter to this two filters in size and felt seal 5231EL1003B filter has a felt seal, and is bigger than ADQ56656401 filter. ✅【COMPATIBILITY】--- 5231EL1003B Lint screen filter can work for LG and Kenmore Dryers.◆Replaces part numbers include 5231EL1002E, 5231EL1003A, 5231EL1003E, 1266857, AP4440606, PS3527578, EAP3527578. ◆5231EL1003B dryer lint filter Compatible with the following models:DLE5977S, DLE5977SM, DLG8388NM, DLG5988SM, DLE9577SM, DLEX7177WM, 79681392610, 79681393610, 79691392610, 79691393610, DLEX2501V,etc.If you are not sure whether this lint filter can be used in your dryer, please contact us and we will help you to confirm. ✅【SIMPLE INSTALLATION】-- Installing the 5231EL1003B clothes dryer lint filter is very simple. Before turning on the strainer, use a screwdriver to remove stains from the track. Take out your old dryer filter and put on a new one.Before the first use, it is necessary to remove the accumulation of fluff in, around and under the dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZJVG8cWVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083LJJYPV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083LJJYPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083LJJYPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
