window.products.push({"id":101897,"name":"YoLink X3 Temperature & Humidity Sensor, Supports App Real-Time Data Refresh, Alexa, IFTTT, Home Assistant Integration - YoLink Hub Required","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TY7KkQNpL._SL1400_.jpg","description":"READY FOR BUSINESS OR HOME: In addition to the features of our family of smart temperature & humidity sensors, this new X3 line sensor features advanced sensor data streaming and storage. View real-time sensor status, and record activity as frequently as 10 minute* intervals. If not connected to the internet, over 64,000 events are stored in the sensor for later uploading to the cloud. *Additional features added with future device updates. POPULAR APPLICATIONS include fridge, freezer and cooler, greenhouse and grow room temperature & humidity monitoring. View current and historical temperature/humidity activity from the app. Receive notifications in the form of SMS, email, and phone push (including Critical Alerts - iOS only). With optional products not included, receive spoken and tone alert notifications from a SpeakerHub, or single-tone alerts from one of our indoor or outdoor sirens. NO WIFI WORRIES! YoLink utilizes a unique wireless format very different from WiFi. Based on LoRa, our devices boast 1/4 mile open-air wireless range, long battery life, and superior obstruction penetration (allowing for placement inside freezers, etc.). Communication is two-way encrypted, protecting your network security and privacy. START SMART! A YoLink hub is REQUIRED for full functionality, including for the app to work, but your hub is compatible with a growing family of smart products for home and business! Search for B09FSS95G9 for a SpeakerHub (our audio, talking hub) or B07TQLKQLJ for the original Hub.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TY7KkQNpL._SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YoLink","source_asin":"B0BG94XMP1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-101897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG94XMP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG94XMP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
